	(text "TI typical application: 2 x 4.7 uF 50 V + 100n at VIN, 100n boot,\n6.8 uH (Isat 13 A, above the 6.7 A peak current limit), 2 x 22 uF\nout. EN tied to VIN: always on. Short CIN-VIN-GND loop and SW node\nover a solid GND pour."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 312.42 19.7 0)
