	(text "Three plated M4 corner holes (6.4 mm ring, not connected; M4\nscrews with a 7 mm head, ISO 4762 / ISO 14580); the fourth\ncorner holds the mains input. Two Bud DNC-4796 steel clips\nfor 35 mm DIN rail, M4 x 8 screws from the top; no bottom\ncopper or THT pins under the clips."
