	(text "Socketed (2 x 21, rows 25.4 mm) so the dev board can be replaced; its USB-C sits at the\nboard edge for flashing and power. Left free: GPIO35-37 (octal PSRAM), GPIO0/45\n(straps), GPIO19/20 (USB). GPIO46 (strap) carries LoRa DIO0, which is low after SX1278\nreset. GPIO43/44 (UART0) carry SD_CS and ETH_INT."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 408.94 100.98 0)
		(effects
