	(text "Plug-in module with its own level shifter: 1x6 GND VCC MISO MOSI SCK\nCS. Its 74LVC125 never releases MISO, so MISO reaches the shared bus\nthrough a 74LVC1G125 enabled only while SD_CS is low. CS GPIO43 (UART0\nTX, 10k pull-up): boot-log activity on it is harmless with SCK idle."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 725.17 172.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "13e3ae99-f049-5ab4-8836-8ddd1ed75255")
	)
