	(text "2 x 1x8 sockets for the Ra-01 adapter. NSS GPIO14 (10k pull-up), DIO0 GPIO46, RESET\nfrom NET_RST (GPIO21, 10k pull-up). Antenna end at the board edge. 10u + 100n for the\n~120 mA transmit current."
