	(text "Second 1x7 socket in the same position as the SIM800L, in the A7670\nboard pin order: 1 GND, 2 URX <- GPIO10, 3 UTX -> GPIO11, 4 PWR-K\nthrough solder jumper JP1, 5 VCC (SIM_5V; the board takes 5-12 V), 6\nGND, 7 SLEEP (open). Fit one board or the other: they share the UART,\nthe supply and the reset line. 4G keeps working where 2G networks are\nswitched off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 134.62 217.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
