		(uuid "f34bf504-d0dc-5a8d-8367-066d9ba189c0")
	)
	(text "Three dry-contact inputs on one ADC pin as a 3-bit resistor DAC: DOOR 2.4k, IN1 5.6k, IN2 13k to\nIN_ADC; IN_ADC 10k up, 8.2k down, 100n. All 8 combinations stay >= 0.17 V apart with 1 % parts and\n3V3 +/-2 %. Per input: 220R + 100n at the connector against ESD and noise; 2.2k pull-up gives ~1.4\nmA wetting current."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 317.5 272.43 0)
		(effects
