	(text "Low-side switch for an external relay or contactor coil. GPIO38 high = on. AO3400A\n(RDS(on) < 48 mR at 2.5 V gate), 100R gate resistor, 100k keeps it off during reset. PTC\n0.5 A / 30 V protects against a shorted coil; SS14 clamps the coil flyback."
